The port lives in src/lib/liljegren.ts and is validated against thermofeel's
own regression fixtures (src/test/fixtures/thermofeel_testcases.csv and
src/test/fixtures/wbgt_liljegren.csv, copied from thermofeel/tests/).

thermofeel constants and property functions are in turn transcribed from
Liljegren's reference C code (MIT-licensed mirror github.com/mdljts/wbgt) and
Kong & Huber (2022), per thermofeel's own attribution.

Reference: Liljegren et al. (2008) https://doi.org/10.1080/15459620802310770
